id=garnet_oos16_uw_fix
name=Garnet Native Lens Switch & Camera Fix
version=v1.6
versionCode=160
author=Vael
description=Universal zero-overlay anti-bootloop camera & lens switch fix for garnet (OOS16, HyperOS 1/2/3/4 CN/Global/ID/EU, Lunaris & AOSP; Magisk/KSU/APatch): post-boot bind-mounts only, built-in Klee-style log-zoom exponential smoother (no LSPosed), universal dynamic ARM64 chi_override resolver, ProGuard-independent dynamic MiuiCamera APK patcher, native Photo/Video SAT lens switching, surgical Titan570 Luma-only NR bypass (with TF20 Chroma refinement active), 0.6x UW LDC, and boosted video bitrates.
